          "filename": "27_1_insample_vs_oof_cleanlab_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import StratifiedKFold, cross_val_predict\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2703)\n\n# Dataset audit: 1.000 tiket moderasi konten, 10% label keliru (100 error sejati)\nX, y_true = make_classification(\n    n_samples=1000,\n    n_features=12,\n    n_informative=7,\n    n_redundant=2,\n    class_sep=2.0,\n    flip_y=0.0,\n    random_state=2703,\n)\nerr_idx = rng.choice(len(X), size=100, replace=False)\ny_noisy = y_true.copy()\ny_noisy[err_idx] = 1 - y_noisy[err_idx]\nis_err = (y_noisy != y_true)\n\ndef audit_detection(probs: np.ndarray, y_obs: np.ndarray, tag: str) -> None:\n    t = np.array([probs[y_obs == j, j].mean() for j in (0, 1)])\n    # Hitung off-diagonal Confident Joint\n    off_diag_flags = np.zeros(len(y_obs), dtype=bool)\n    for i in range(len(y_obs)):\n        elig = np.where(probs[i] >= t)[0]\n        if len(elig) > 0:\n            j_star = int(elig[np.argmax(probs[i, elig])])\n            if j_star != y_obs[i]:\n                off_diag_flags[i] = True\n    # Ranking antrian review manusia berdasarkan self-confidence terendah\n    self_conf = probs[np.arange(len(y_obs)), y_obs]\n    order = np.argsort(self_conf)\n    prec_at_50 = float(is_err[order[:50]].mean())\n    prec_at_100 = float(is_err[order[:100]].mean())\n    rec_cl = float(np.sum(off_diag_flags & is_err) / is_err.sum())\n    print(\n        f\"{tag:30s} | t=[{t[0]:.3f}, {t[1]:.3f}] | Flagged={int(off_diag_flags.sum()):3d} \"\n        f\"| Recall-CL={rec_cl:.3f} | P@50={prec_at_50:.3f} | P@100={prec_at_100:.3f}\"\n    )\n\n# 1) ANTI-PATTERN: Probabilitas IN-SAMPLE dari RandomForest tanpa batasan kedalaman\nrf_overfit = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=100, max_depth=None, random_state=42)\nrf_overfit.fit(X, y_noisy)\np_insample = rf_overfit.predict_proba(X)\n\n# 2) PRODUCTION-SAFE: Probabilitas OUT-OF-FOLD 5-Fold StratifiedKFold pada estimator identik\nskf = StratifiedKFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\np_oof = cross_val_predict(\n    RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=100, max_depth=None, random_state=42),\n    X, y_noisy, cv=skf, method=\"predict_proba\",\n)\n\nprint(\"=== Audit Kegagalan Senyap: In-Sample vs Out-of-Fold (OOF) Confident Learning ===\")\naudit_detection(p_insample, y_noisy, \"BUG: In-Sample predict_proba\")\naudit_detection(p_oof, y_noisy, \"SAFE: 5-Fold OOF predict_proba\")\nprint(f\"Rata-rata Self-Confidence pd 100 label rusak -> In-Sample={p_insample[np.arange(len(X)), y_noisy][is_err].mean():.3f} (terhafal!) vs OOF={p_oof[np.arange(len(X)), y_noisy][is_err].mean():.3f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit Kegagalan Senyap: In-Sample vs Out-of-Fold (OOF) Confident Learning ===\nBUG: In-Sample predict_proba   | t=[0.920, 0.915] | Flagged=  0 | Recall-CL=0.000 | P@50=1.000 | P@100=0.930\nSAFE: 5-Fold OOF predict_proba | t=[0.781, 0.775] | Flagged= 80 | Recall-CL=0.800 | P@50=1.000 | P@100=0.970\nRata-rata Self-Confidence pd 100 label rusak -> In-Sample=0.691 (terhafal!) vs OOF=0.157",
          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Kegagalan Senyap: In-Sample vs Out-of-Fold (OOF) Confident Learning ===\nBUG: In-Sample predict_proba   | t=[0.920, 0.915] | Flagged=  0 | Recall-CL=0.000 | P@50=1.000 | P@100=0.930\nSAFE: 5-Fold OOF predict_proba | t=[0.781, 0.775] | Flagged= 80 | Recall-CL=0.800 | P@50=1.000 | P@100=0.970\nRata-rata Self-Confidence pd 100 label rusak -> In-Sample=0.691 (terhafal!) vs OOF=0.157",
