          "id": "code-ml-27-2-ch27_2_scratch",
          "title": "First-Principles NumPy: Dawid-Skene / Snorkel EM Label Model (Abstain + LF Beracun) -> Soft-Label End Model",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "27_2_snorkel_em_label_model_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.metrics import f1_score, roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2721)\n\n# 1) Dataset transaksi keuangan (N=1.400): hanya fitur X tersedia tanpa label manual!\nN = 1400\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(N, 6))\ntrue_logit = 1.4 * X[:, 0] + 1.1 * X[:, 1] - 0.9 * X[:, 2] + 0.7 * X[:, 3] - 0.8\ny_true = (rng.uniform(size=N) < 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-true_logit))).astype(int)\n\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr_true, y_te_true = train_test_split(\n    X, y_true, test_size=0.30, stratify=y_true, random_state=42\n)\n\n# 2) Bangun 6 Labeling Functions (LF) heuristik dengan abstain (-1) + 1 LF BERACUN (akurasi ~30%!)\ndef apply_lfs(X_mat: np.ndarray, y_ref: np.ndarray, seed: int) -> np.ndarray:\n    r = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    n = len(X_mat)\n    L = np.full((n, 6), -1, dtype=int)\n    # LF0..LF4: heuristik domain dengan cakupan 40-65% dan akurasi 76-88%\n    specs = [(0.55, 0.88), (0.50, 0.84), (0.60, 0.80), (0.45, 0.78), (0.40, 0.82), (0.75, 0.28)]\n    for j, (cov, acc) in enumerate(specs):\n        active = r.uniform(size=n) < cov\n        correct = r.uniform(size=n) < acc\n        L[active, j] = np.where(correct[active], y_ref[active], 1 - y_ref[active])\n    return L\n\nL_tr = apply_lfs(X_tr, y_tr_true, seed=2722)\n\n# 3) Baseline Naive Majority Vote (menganggap semua LF berbobot setara!)\npos_votes = np.sum(L_tr == 1, axis=1)\nneg_votes = np.sum(L_tr == 0, axis=1)\ncovered = (pos_votes + neg_votes) > 0\ny_mv = (pos_votes >= neg_votes).astype(int)\nmv_acc = float(np.mean(y_mv[covered] == y_tr_true[covered]))\n\n# 4) Generative Label Model (Dawid-Skene / Snorkel EM dengan Abstain) murni NumPy\ndef fit_snorkel_em(L: np.ndarray, n_iter: int = 35) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray, float]:\n    n, m = L.shape\n    pi = 0.5\n    alpha = np.full(m, 0.70, dtype=float)  # Inisialisasi konservatif P(LF_j == y* | non-abstain)\n    gamma = np.full(n, 0.5, dtype=float)\n    eps = 1e-6\n    for _ in range(n_iter):\n        # E-Step dalam ruang log-likelihood demi stabilitas numerik\n        log_p1 = np.full(n, np.log(np.clip(pi, eps, 1 - eps)))\n        log_p0 = np.full(n, np.log(np.clip(1.0 - pi, eps, 1 - eps)))\n        for j in range(m):\n            a_j = np.clip(alpha[j], eps, 1.0 - eps)\n            m1 = (L[:, j] == 1)\n            m0 = (L[:, j] == 0)\n            log_p1[m1] += np.log(a_j)\n            log_p0[m1] += np.log(1.0 - a_j)\n            log_p1[m0] += np.log(1.0 - a_j)\n            log_p0[m0] += np.log(a_j)\n        # Log-sum-exp stabil\n        m_max = np.maximum(log_p1, log_p0)\n        p1 = np.exp(log_p1 - m_max)\n        p0 = np.exp(log_p0 - m_max)\n        gamma = p1 / (p1 + p0)\n\n        # M-Step: perbarui prior kelas pi & akurasi tiap LF alpha_j (dengan Laplace smoothing)\n        pi = float(np.clip(gamma.mean(), 0.05, 0.95))\n        for j in range(m):\n            act = (L[:, j] != -1)\n            if act.sum() == 0:\n                continue\n            agree_prob = np.where(L[act, j] == 1, gamma[act], 1.0 - gamma[act])\n            alpha[j] = float((agree_prob.sum() + 1.0) / (act.sum() + 2.0))\n    return gamma, alpha, pi\n\nsoft_y, alpha_hat, pi_hat = fit_snorkel_em(L_tr)\nem_acc = float(np.mean((soft_y[covered] >= 0.5).astype(int) == y_tr_true[covered]))\n\n# 5) Latih End Model diskriminatif dengan PROBABILISTIC SOFT LABELS (noise-aware loss via sample_weight!)\n#    Untuk setiap sampel i (covered), duplikasi kelas 1 berbobot soft_y[i] & kelas 0 berbobot (1 - soft_y[i])\nX_cov = X_tr[covered]\nX_soft = np.vstack([X_cov, X_cov])\ny_soft_cls = np.concatenate([np.ones(len(X_cov), dtype=int), np.zeros(len(X_cov), dtype=int)])\nw_soft = np.concatenate([soft_y[covered], 1.0 - soft_y[covered]])\n\nclf_mv = LogisticRegression(C=1.0, max_iter=500).fit(X_cov, y_mv[covered])\nclf_em = LogisticRegression(C=1.0, max_iter=500).fit(X_soft, y_soft_cls, sample_weight=w_soft)\nclf_oracle = LogisticRegression(C=1.0, max_iter=500).fit(X_tr, y_tr_true)\n\nprint(\"=== Weak Supervision: Dawid-Skene / Snorkel EM Label Model Dari Nol ===\")\nprint(f\"Cakupan LF pada Train (min 1 LF aktif): {int(covered.sum())}/{len(X_tr)} ({100*covered.mean():.1f}%)\")\nprint(f\"Estimasi akurasi LF (alpha_hat)       : {np.round(alpha_hat, 3).tolist()}  <-- LF5 beracun (0.28) terdeteksi!\")\nprint(f\"Akurasi Label Latih (Covered)         : MajorityVote={mv_acc:.4f} vs Snorkel-EM={em_acc:.4f}\")\nfor tag, mod in [(\"End-Model Majority Vote\", clf_mv), (\"End-Model Snorkel EM Soft\", clf_em), (\"Oracle (100% Label Manusia)\", clf_oracle)]:\n    p = mod.predict_proba(X_te)[:, 1]\n    print(f\"{tag:28s} -> Test ROC-AUC={roc_auc_score(y_te_true, p):.4f} | F1={f1_score(y_te_true, (p>=0.5).astype(int)):.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Weak Supervision: Dawid-Skene / Snorkel EM Label Model Dari Nol ===\nCakupan LF pada Train (min 1 LF aktif): 977/980 (99.7%)\nEstimasi akurasi LF (alpha_hat)       : [0.885, 0.846, 0.835, 0.75, 0.812, 0.313]  <-- LF5 beracun (0.28) terdeteksi!\nAkurasi Label Latih (Covered)         : MajorityVote=0.7697 vs Snorkel-EM=0.9069\nEnd-Model Majority Vote      -> Test ROC-AUC=0.8857 | F1=0.7556\nEnd-Model Snorkel EM Soft    -> Test ROC-AUC=0.8962 | F1=0.7403\nOracle (100% Label Manusia)  -> Test ROC-AUC=0.8945 | F1=0.7515",
          "actualOutput": "=== Weak Supervision: Dawid-Skene / Snorkel EM Label Model Dari Nol ===\nCakupan LF pada Train (min 1 LF aktif): 977/980 (99.7%)\nEstimasi akurasi LF (alpha_hat)       : [0.885, 0.846, 0.835, 0.75, 0.812, 0.313]  <-- LF5 beracun (0.28) terdeteksi!\nAkurasi Label Latih (Covered)         : MajorityVote=0.7697 vs Snorkel-EM=0.9069\nEnd-Model Majority Vote      -> Test ROC-AUC=0.8857 | F1=0.7556\nEnd-Model Snorkel EM Soft    -> Test ROC-AUC=0.8962 | F1=0.7403\nOracle (100% Label Manusia)  -> Test ROC-AUC=0.8945 | F1=0.7515",
