          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.metrics import average_precision_score, brier_score_loss, roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2741)\n\n# 1) Dataset tabular imbalanced ekstrem (prevalensi positif pi = 2.5%, N = 1.600)\nX, y = make_classification(\n    n_samples=1600,\n    n_features=10,\n    n_informative=6,\n    n_redundant=2,\n    weights=[0.975, 0.025],\n    class_sep=1.6,\n    flip_y=0.005,\n    random_state=2741,\n)\nX_tr_raw, X_te_raw, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.35, stratify=y, random_state=42)\nsc = StandardScaler().fit(X_tr_raw)\nX_tr = sc.transform(X_tr_raw)\nX_te = sc.transform(X_te_raw)\n\n# 2) Implementasi SMOTE murni NumPy (interpolasi k=5 tetangga terdekat kelas minoritas)\ndef smote_numpy(X_in: np.ndarray, y_in: np.ndarray, k: int = 5, seed: int = 42) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n    r = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    X_min = X_in[y_in == 1]\n    n_maj = int(np.sum(y_in == 0))\n    n_syn = n_maj - len(X_min)\n    # Matriks jarak Euclidean antar titik minoritas\n    dmat = np.linalg.norm(X_min[:, None, :] - X_min[None, :, :], axis=-1)\n    np.fill_diagonal(dmat, np.inf)\n    nn_idx = np.argsort(dmat, axis=1)[:, : min(k, len(X_min) - 1)]\n    base_i = r.integers(0, len(X_min), size=n_syn)\n    nbr_k = r.integers(0, nn_idx.shape[1], size=n_syn)\n    nbr_i = nn_idx[base_i, nbr_k]\n    lam = r.uniform(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_syn, 1))\n    X_syn = X_min[base_i] + lam * (X_min[nbr_i] - X_min[base_i])\n    return np.vstack([X_in, X_syn]), np.concatenate([y_in, np.ones(n_syn, dtype=int)])\n\n# 3) Model Logistik Linear: (a) Proper Log-Loss vs (b) Focal Loss (Lin et al., 2017) gradien eksak!\ndef sigmoid(z: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    return 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-np.clip(z, -30.0, 30.0)))\n\ndef fit_binary_loss(X_m: np.ndarray, y_m: np.ndarray, gamma: float = 0.0, l2: float = 1e-2) -> np.ndarray:\n    Xa = np.column_stack([np.ones(len(X_m)), X_m])\n    w0 = np.zeros(Xa.shape[1])\n    y_f = y_m.astype(float)\n\n    def obj_and_grad(w: np.ndarray):\n        z = Xa @ w\n        p = np.clip(sigmoid(z), 1e-9, 1.0 - 1e-9)\n        pt = np.where(y_f == 1.0, p, 1.0 - p)\n        mod = (1.0 - pt) ** gamma\n        loss = -np.mean(mod * np.log(pt)) + 0.5 * l2 * np.sum(w[1:] ** 2)\n        # Turunan analitis eksak dL/dz untuk Focal Loss (berkurang ke p - y saat gamma = 0!)\n        # d[-((1-pt)^g * log(pt))]/dpt = (1-pt)^(g-1) * (g*log(pt) - (1-pt)/pt)\n        # dan dpt/dz = (2y - 1) * p * (1 - p) = (2y - 1) * pt * (1 - pt)\n        dL_dz = (2.0 * y_f - 1.0) * mod * (gamma * pt * np.log(pt) - (1.0 - pt))\n        grad = (Xa.T @ dL_dz) / len(X_m)\n        grad[1:] += l2 * w[1:]\n        return float(loss), grad\n\n    res = minimize(obj_and_grad, w0, jac=True, method=\"BFGS\")\n    return res.x\n\ndef predict_prob(w: np.ndarray, X_m: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    return sigmoid(np.column_stack([np.ones(len(X_m)), X_m]) @ w)\n\ndef compute_ece(y_true_arr: np.ndarray, probs: np.ndarray, n_bins: int = 10) -> float:\n    bins = np.linspace(0.0, 1.0, n_bins + 1)\n    ece = 0.0\n    for b in range(n_bins):\n        mask = (probs >= bins[b]) & (probs <= bins[b + 1] if b == n_bins - 1 else probs < bins[b + 1])\n        if mask.any():\n            ece += float(mask.mean()) * abs(float(y_true_arr[mask].mean()) - float(probs[mask].mean()))\n    return ece\n\n# 4) Latih 3 model + Koreksi Log-Odds Analitis Elkan/Saerens untuk SMOTE\nw_native = fit_binary_loss(X_tr, y_tr, gamma=0.0)\nX_sm, y_sm = smote_numpy(X_tr, y_tr, k=5, seed=42)\nw_smote = fit_binary_loss(X_sm, y_sm, gamma=0.0)\nw_focal = fit_binary_loss(X_tr, y_tr, gamma=2.0)\n\np_native = predict_prob(w_native, X_te)\np_smote = predict_prob(w_smote, X_te)\np_focal = predict_prob(w_focal, X_te)\n\n# Koreksi prior-shift analitis pada SMOTE: logit(p_cal) = logit(p_smote) - ln((pi'/(1-pi')) / (pi/(1-pi)))\npi_true = float(y_tr.mean())\npi_bal = float(y_sm.mean())\nshift = np.log((pi_bal / (1.0 - pi_bal)) / (pi_true / (1.0 - pi_true)))\nz_sm = np.log(np.clip(p_smote, 1e-9, 1 - 1e-9) / np.clip(1.0 - p_smote, 1e-9, 1 - 1e-9))\np_smote_recal = sigmoid(z_sm - shift)\n\nprint(f\"=== Uji Mitos SMOTE vs Native Log-Loss vs Focal Loss (gamma=2) | Prevalensi Asli = {100*pi_true:.2f}% ===\")\nfor name, p in [\n    (\"1. Native Proper Log-Loss\", p_native),\n    (\"2. SMOTE 50:50 (Mentah!)\", p_smote),\n    (\"3. SMOTE + Prior Recalib\", p_smote_recal),\n    (\"4. Focal Loss (gamma=2.0)\", p_focal),\n]:\n    print(\n        f\"{name:26s} | ROC-AUC={roc_auc_score(y_te, p):.4f} | PR-AUC={average_precision_score(y_te, p):.4f} \"\n        f\"| Brier={brier_score_loss(y_te, p):.4f} | ECE={compute_ece(y_te, p):.4f} | MeanP={p.mean():.4f}\"\n    )",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Uji Mitos SMOTE vs Native Log-Loss vs Focal Loss (gamma=2) | Prevalensi Asli = 2.79% ===\n1. Native Proper Log-Loss  | ROC-AUC=0.9284 | PR-AUC=0.5572 | Brier=0.0179 | ECE=0.0158 | MeanP=0.0283\n2. SMOTE 50:50 (Mentah!)   | ROC-AUC=0.9128 | PR-AUC=0.5297 | Brier=0.1068 | ECE=0.2182 | MeanP=0.2450\n3. SMOTE + Prior Recalib   | ROC-AUC=0.9128 | PR-AUC=0.5297 | Brier=0.0179 | ECE=0.0079 | MeanP=0.0224\n4. Focal Loss (gamma=2.0)  | ROC-AUC=0.9261 | PR-AUC=0.5914 | Brier=0.0391 | ECE=0.1424 | MeanP=0.1607",
          "actualOutput": "=== Uji Mitos SMOTE vs Native Log-Loss vs Focal Loss (gamma=2) | Prevalensi Asli = 2.79% ===\n1. Native Proper Log-Loss  | ROC-AUC=0.9284 | PR-AUC=0.5572 | Brier=0.0179 | ECE=0.0158 | MeanP=0.0283\n2. SMOTE 50:50 (Mentah!)   | ROC-AUC=0.9128 | PR-AUC=0.5297 | Brier=0.1068 | ECE=0.2182 | MeanP=0.2450\n3. SMOTE + Prior Recalib   | ROC-AUC=0.9128 | PR-AUC=0.5297 | Brier=0.0179 | ECE=0.0079 | MeanP=0.0224\n4. Focal Loss (gamma=2.0)  | ROC-AUC=0.9261 | PR-AUC=0.5914 | Brier=0.0391 | ECE=0.1424 | MeanP=0.1607",
